rooms_desc ({"You're in a large, airy room with floor and walls of black veined marble.The lofty ceiling is also pure black. The floor is decorated with large,mystical symbols and runes of the long-forgotten summoner language.There are two small glass-topped tables, each with five comfortable-lookingchairs arranged around it. On each table stands a crystal decanter, a bowl offruits and five crystal glasses.At the far end of the room a large double-door can be seen.","You enter a long corridor. The walls are made of the same black veined marble.Hanging on the walls are various pictures of strange, exotic and quite ordinalcreatures. Hanging from the ceiling is a crystal chandelier which fills the whole room with bright magical light. At the far end of the corridor are twodoors, one on each side. You can notice a small sign on the left one.","This chamber seems to be a combination of office and bedroom. A huge bed,lushly canopied and quilted, nearly fills the southern end. A large woodencloset sits next to it. Across the floor are spread rugs made from the skinsof many of the large carnivores found throughout the world: brown bears,jaguars, panthers, wolves and a tiger.The other end of the room is taken up by a large desk, plain wooden chair andsmall table. Few tapestries, picturing monsters and scenes of element-wroughtdestructions, add a dark touch to the walls. Several torches flicker in scones.","This is a huge room. The walls are lined with bookshelves. In the center isa large stone table. Bottles and beakers of various chemicals are found both onthe stone table and in other parts of the laboratory. At the far corners,almost obscured by shadows, stand two golems, an iron and a silver.",0,0,0,0,0,0,})
