items ({({"walls","Walls of black marble, radiating strong magic","ceiling","Black marble ceiling, 40 feet above","runes","Strange golden runes engraved in the marble","tables","Glass-topped tables","decanters","The decanters contain a mildy intoxicating, perfectly transparent wine.","wine","Colourless wine","bowl","Following fruits are in the bowl: oranges, figs and grapes","glasses","Glasses made of crystal","chairs","Sit down| They are comfortable|","double-door","A double-door, leading into the living quarters",}),({"walls","Black marble walls. Looks magical, but you are not sure","picture","Which one ?","pictures","Pictures of Sorceror's favourite monsters: native warriors, dragons and a       Vampire Lord.","ceiling","40 feet above.","chandelier","A very expensive looking crystal chandelier","northern door","It's a strong wooden door with a complex lock on it","southern door","A simple wooden door, there's a sign on it.","sign","It reads: LABORATORY|                                                                      KEEP OUT|","door","Which one?",}),({"table","Looks like a very ordinaly table, made of oak.",}),0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
